title: ImagePresence · cached archive readback
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> begin
    begin --> begin: Evict [present]
    begin --> tag: Begin [tag]
    begin --> readback: Begin [digest]
    tag --> tag: Expire [fresh]
    tag --> tag: ChangeAvailability
    tag --> readback: ResolveTag [selected]
    tag --> refused: ResolveTag [missing]
    begin --> verify: Begin [explicit]
    readback --> ready: Readback [proof, present]
    readback --> refused: Readback [refusal]
    readback --> verify: Readback [needs archive]
    verify --> refused: Verify [changed]
    verify --> verified: Verify [clean]
    verified --> ready: Reconcile [present]
    verified --> refused: Reconcile [refusal]
    verified --> upload: Reconcile [absent]
    upload --> ready: Upload [readback observed]
    ready --> ready: Evict [present]
    ready --> created: Create [present]
    ready --> create_refused: Create [absent]
    created --> [*]
    create_refused --> [*]
    refused --> [*]
    class begin idle
    class tag,readback,verify,verified,upload live
    class ready,created ok
    class refused,create_refused fail
    note right of tag
        Fresh normal commands use the record.
        Refresh or expiry checks the registry.
        Fallback needs proof and presence.
        Explicit refresh refuses on error.
    end note
    note right of ready
        INV: success observed the exact image.
        Upload requires a verified archive.
    end note
    note right of refused
        Foreign intent and unknown or wrong
        guest identity refuse. A same-boot
        unresolved load with absence refuses.
    end note
